{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"; Skapa en raster bar f\u00F6r bakgrund\nRASTER 3, 0, 0, 480, \u0022DarkBlue, Blue, Cyan, White, DarkBlue\u0022\n\n; Aktivera wrap (nu forts\u00E4tter baren \u00E4ven utanf\u00F6r sk\u00E4rmens gr\u00E4nser)\nRASTER WRAP 3, 1 \n\n; Animera den ned\u00E5t - n\u00E4r den g\u00E5r utanf\u00F6r sk\u00E4rmen kommer den tillbaka upptill!\ny = 0\nWhile 1\n    RASTER MOVE 3, y\n    y = y - 2\n    IF y = -480 THEN y = 0  ; \u00C5terst\u00E4ll f\u00F6r smooth loop\n    WAIT VBL\nWend","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}